# React Components

## Component shape

```tsx
export interface IMyModalData {
  item: IItem;
}

const MyModal: React.FC = () => {
  const { data } = useModalState<IMyModalData>();
  const { closeModal } = useModalAction();
  const { t } = useTranslation();
  // ...
};
```

## Styling

- **Tailwind** utilities; conditional classes via `cn()` from `src/utils/helpers`
- Design tokens (`text-primary`, `bg-error-500`) over arbitrary values
- Icons from `src/components/icons/`; spread `React.SVGAttributes` props

## i18n

- All user-facing text via `useTranslation()` / `t('namespace.key')`
- Add keys in **both** `public/locales/en/translation.json` and `public/locales/ar/translation.json`

## Modals & drawers

- Open via context: `openModal('VIEW_NAME', payload)` / `openDrawer('VIEW_NAME', payload)`
- Read payload: `useModalState<T>()` / drawer equivalent
- Register new views in context type **and** container switch — never mount inline on pages

## Errors & loading

- `renderError(error)` for toast messages
- `toast.success()` / `toast.error()` from `src/components/toast`
- `handleBackendValidationErrors()` + React Hook Form `setError` for form errors
- `QueryStateWrapper` for single-query page loading/error/retry

## Routes

- Use `routes` from `src/config/routes.ts` — never hardcode paths
